Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the VADC using an incorrect voltage reference (1.25V) for channel calibration of the temperature channels instead of the correct reference (1.875V). This misconfiguration led to inaccurate temperature readings being exported to the thermal framework. Additionally, the lack of a sufficient delay between AMUX configuration and ADC conversion could have further contributed to unreliable readings.

